v\": [[\"whats the last thing i wrote in my journal\", \"also which expenses were over fourteen\"], [\"I was trying to remember how I'd been feeling lately and figured my journal would say — what was the last thing I wrote in it?\", \"Different thing, I'm trying to rein in my spending a bit, so which expenses were over fourteen?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0006\", \"v\": [[\"where am I with Priziel in flint fund?\", \"and Drennette?\"], [\"umm where do I stand with Priziel in flint fund?\", \"ok and, uh, Drennette?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0007\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me when I was last in touch with Enou Gokhale, please?\", \"Also, would you mind showing me which documents are in the bin?\"], [\"hmm when did I last, uh, get in touch with Enou Gokhale?\", \"oh and um what documents have I got sitting in the bin?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0008\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to keep better track of who I actually see these days, so can you log that I went to Treskan's — I visited today?\", \"Oh sorry, I should've said — it was Treskan Yildiz.\", \"Okay, different thing, I want to get myself organised — what's still on my list?\", \"Hang on, quick one before I lose the thought — what's due monday?\", \"Okay, going back to the open tasks — I actually finished the second one, so can you tick it off?\"], [\"Could you please log that I visited Treskan today? Actually — could you log for Treskan that I visited today, please?\", \"I meant Treskan Yildiz, please.\", \"Could you tell me what's still on my list, please?\", \"Sorry, hang on — could you tell me what's due monday?\", \"Thank you. Going back to the open tasks, would you please tick off the second one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0009\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please log for Treskan, the dog groomer one, that I visited today?\"], [\"pls log Treskan the dog groomer one, i visited today\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w26-0010\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please delete the mycology photo?\", \"Thank you. Could you tell me what is still due monday?\", \"Also, coul